OL,3,GNEWSANo threat to public after
OL,4,Asuspected drone at US air base, says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has assured people there is "no
OL,7,Fthreat to the public" after suspected
OL,8,Funauthorised drone activity at RAF
OL,9,FLakenheath in Suffolk.
OL,11,FThe US Air Force (USAF) said it had
OL,12,Fdealt with the incident and no
OL,13,Fpersonnel, aircraft or infrastructure
OL,14,Fwere affected.
OL,16,FNick Timothy, the Conservative MP for
OL,17,FWest Suffolk, said he had contacted
OL,18,Fauthorities at the base following
OL,19,Freports of security alarms sounding.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
